        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "@231tr0n, `@none` now doesn't have explicit highlighting in 'mini.hues'. The main obstacle of \"official\" documentation on 'nvim-treesitter' is now gone (as it is transitioning to `main` branch which doesn't have `@none` documented), so it is finally \"correct\" to remove the link to `Normal`.",
